# ============================================================================
# PRODUCTION env vars baked into the desktop installer (and any locally built
# production frontend bundle). Vite loads this file in addition to `.env`
# whenever the build runs with `--mode production`, which is the default for
# `vite build` and `npm run tauri:build`.
#
# All VITE_* vars end up in the public client bundle, so do NOT put secrets
# here. The Supabase anon key below is intentionally public by design.
# Real secrets (Spotify, Supabase service role, etc.) live in Render's
# dashboard env vars on the API service and Vercel's env vars on the web
# services — never in this file.
# ============================================================================

